          "value": "Causes an allergic reaction in human. Binds to IgE of patients allergic to London plane tree pollen (PubMed:15208603, PubMed:17177673). Binds to IgE in 84% of the 26 patients tested (PubMed:15208603). Binds to IgE in 50% of the 26 patients tested (PubMed:17177673)"
